window.products.push({"id":959087,"name":"Electric Space Heater, Portable 90°Oscillating Heater with Overheating and Tipping-Over Protection, 2s Fast Heating Small Energy-saving Silent Heater ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pbVV04rbL._AC_SL1429_.jpg","description":"☪With the warm companionship of our portable heaters, the whole winter will no longer be cold.☪🔥This mini heater uses a highly efficient and stable heating element, and uses a fan to achieve convection circulation to quickly transfer the heat generated by the heater to a certain range in the room.☃Product Highlights:༒·3 modesThere are 3 energy-saving modes to meet your different needs.High: 1200W, instant heating with high power.Low: 600W, slow heating with low power.Fan only: Just like a small table fan.༒·90°OscillationThis heater has a left-right oscillation function, which can better dissipate heat in multiple directions. Of course, it can also be fixed to heat in one direction. For details, please refer to the manual and the small icon on the top of the object.༒·Built-in grooved handleOn the top of the back side of the space heater, there is a groove design, which is convenient for you to move it and effectively avoid your skin from being burned. ༒·Removable filterThe dust filter can reduce dust, pollen and particles in the air, providing you with clean and warm air. It is easy to disassemble and clean.☃Precautions:💖·When the heater is running, please do not place it too close to the radiator to avoid burns.💖·Turn off the power before unplugging the plug. Please do not touch the power supply with wet hands, otherwise there is a danger of electric shock.💖·This product should be placed at least 3 feet away from walls and furniture, and it is not easy to place flammable materials in front of it.💖·Do not use this heater in wet places such as bathrooms to avoid electric leakage accidents.💖·For other detailed precautions, please refer to the manual.☃Product specifications:Length: 6.3inchWidth: 6.3inchHeight: 10inchLine Length: 55inch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pbVV04rbL._AC_SL1429_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BY Mistletoe","source_asin":"B09RZHYCBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RZHYCBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RZHYCBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
