window.products.push({"id":959104,"name":"VEVOR 6-Tier Cookware Stand, 61-inch Multi-Layer Pot Rack, Carbon Steel Cookware Shelf, Cookware Storage Tower, Unassembled Kitchen Corner Shelf Rack ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VOXWI8vXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Store All Your Pots & Pans On A Single Rack: Designed with 61.2x19.7 inch large storage units, this item is perfect for creating a comprehensive system that allows you to keep kitchen cookwares neatly contained. It features 6 spacious shelves, 4-8 inches blank between each layer, ideal for holding pans, bowls, discs, basins, vegetable baskets, kettles, and plants. Large Load Bearing Cookware: This graphite corner shelf for the kitchen comes with 6 layers sized to handle larger supplies, and each shelf accommodates up to 22 lb. of weight, making it ideal for storing heavy utensils. It can support up to 132.3 lb. total. In addition, the superior triangular construction adds extra stability and storage space to meet your ever-changing needs! Premium Quality You Can Trust: Built to withstand the wear and tear of everyday use, this kitchen appliance rack is made entirely of carbon steel that is stable, waterproof, rustproof, and easy to clean. Meanwhile, it is 3 mm in thickness, provides optimal strength for continuous support and stability. In addition, this corner baker's rack with a plastic-sprayed surface and rounded edges can guard your hands. Space Saver & Installation Needed: Corners tend to be wasted space in kitchen storage areas, but this shelf kit helps you make the most of every inch of storage or display space by fitting easily into those corners. This complete kit comes with complete posts and shelves. Plus, with a lightweight, moving this item is a breeze! Multipurpose For Mixture Of Different Pots And Pans: This kitchen appliance organizer is an excellent addition to family kitchens, commercial kitchens, cafeterias, and bathrooms where systematic organization and daily essentials are essential.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VOXWI8vXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B0BDFRMJBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDFRMJBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDFRMJBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
