window.products.push({"id":959153,"name":"OYRIS Graduated Beaker Coffee Mug with Handle and Durable Bamboo Lid Borosilicate Glass Multi-Function Food Grade Milk Measuring Cup 500ml","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wc4uM94IS._AC_SL1205_.jpg","description":"Sold as 1pcs 500ml thick borosilicate glass measuring beaker cup with handle and solid bamboo cover lid.Standard scale:We carefully measured the actual volume/capacity of the glass measuring cup to make it clearly for you, please check the picture as you want to choose.The measurement starts from 50 ml to 350 ml with 25 ml step value.Professional design of V-shaped spout makes liquids can be pouring straight for easy to drainage. This means you’ll have accuracy at every angle, letting you pour in your liquids and ingredients without drips, spills, or mess.Convenient insulated handle.Warning:the measuring cup cannot be dry burning and ensure that there must be water in the cup when heating. Most chemical liquids, such as acids and bases, can be placed except hydrofluoric acid.Features Food grade glass measuring cup made of borosilicate glass can withstand a temperature difference of 200 degrees. Suitable for microwave ovens Gas stoves can also be placed in the refrigerator for refrigeration. It can also be used in laboratories,It can also be used in laboratories.It has elegant shape and high ornamental and fun. Material and specifications The cup body has a linear thermal expansion coefficient of(3.3±0.1)×10-6/k international ISO standard made of high borosilicate glass ,Caliber 8CM high 14CM capacity 500ml. Product performance Non-toxic, lead-free, no side effects, good thermal stability, light transmission, alkali resistance, acid resistance, environmental protection and healty. Use and design effects For drinking water, foamed milk, baking (insulated handle), measuring wine, experiment, alcohol-adjusting V-shaped nozzle can be directly dumped for drainage and easy to clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wc4uM94IS._AC_SL1205_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OYRIS","source_asin":"B0952NCGCB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0952NCGCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0952NCGCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":959154,"name":"Bedford Cottage Marrakesh Sweater Knit Chevron Throw, 50 by 80-Inch, Terracotta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Tt-HtEdDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Bedford Cottage Marrakesh Sweater Knit Chevron Throw, Comfort, Style and Warmth for Every Room in Your Home-The colors in this great, sweater knit throw combine and recombine in so many different ways; they call to mind the vibrant richness of ethnic markets. The Marrakesh chevron also speaks to its wonderful apparel heritage with the softer flannel color way. Knit with 100-percent acrylic yarns gives this throw a soft, silky feel that you'll love for years. Designed with a decorative 4-inch fringe on each end and extra border detail adds even more texture, beauty and appeal to the hand and eye. It measures a generous oversized 50-by-80 Inch making it great to use as an accent and roomy enough to use as an extra layer on your bed or simply as a couch snuggling companion. Hand wash in cold water, lay flat to dry. Other Bedford Cottage/Kennebunk Home Throws also available thru Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Tt-HtEdDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bedford Cottage","source_asin":"B0099L3404","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0099L3404","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0099L3404","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
