window.products.push({"id":959256,"name":"SegMiniSmart Jade Roller, 7 inch, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pAluwhHJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Announcing The easiest, most affordable way to create great art! As artists work with Ariana's Art Vivid Color, this set quickly becomes their go-to colored pencils! Ariana's Art Vivid Color pencils were created for Artists and older art students. We provide you with a quality product that inexpensively fulfills your needs while eliminating the frustrations often experienced with other premium pencils. - Our pencils easily allow you to create the exact colors you wish with rich color pigmentation; blend them effortlessly and burnish them to your liking - Our high-quality canvas carrying/storage pencil case is not only stylish but makes it easy to rapidly find the exact color you need, and it’s FREE! - Our pencils are made of high quality basswood with soft cores that offer superb blending and shading Our unique triangular shape has been created for comfort while drawing. Once you try it you will wonder why all writing utensils aren’t shaped this way Created for the serious art student and professional, we are so sure you will love our pencils that we unconditionally your satisfaction! - Bonus! This premier set will arrive with a quality canvas carrying case with your pencils, a pencil sharpener and quality eraser at no extra charge! - 48 distinct colors including black and white The Only Colored Pencil Set Backed by a Lifetime No-Hassle Free Replacement ! Click the button at the top of this page to get your Artist Quality Colored Pencil Set Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pAluwhHJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEGMINISMART","source_asin":"B00OKZ9XMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OKZ9XMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OKZ9XMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":959257,"name":"Mosser Jade 3 Piece Mixing Bowl Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41we0H0jlML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Glass Mixing Bowls: USA Made! These gleaming bowls are not only versatile, but they're well crafted thanks to a family business in Ohio. Each glass piece they make is hand-pressed! A good set of mixing bowls is a must for every baker and home cook, so choose tried-and-true quality. . Includes three bowls: 20-oz Bowl: 5-1/2\"OD x 3\"H, 40-oz Bowl: 7\"OD x 3-1/2\"H, 65-oz Bowl: 8-1/2\"OD x 4\"H. Crafted by a family-owned and operated glassware company in Ohio. Clean with mild detergent and water. Let glassware reach room temperature before washing. Use nylon or plastic sponge to avoid scratches.. Crafted in Our Home State! We're so proud to have found these mixing bowls right in our home state of Ohio, where a family-owned and -operated business makes some of the most beautiful glassware we've seen. Their classic designs and careful craftsmanship may just remind you of a different era. Each piece is made following a time-honored method of pressing glass - from using cast iron molds to polishing and annealing (which the latter takes 3.5 hours alone). The results are stunning!How to Care for Your Mosser Glassware How you handle your glassware is important and will help protect it for years to come. Avoiding mechanical and thermal shock is essential. Here are a few tips from Mosser Glass: Avoid glass to glass contact. If putting away your item on a shelf, do not allow the glass to touch. Avoid stacking as well. Avoid quick changes in temperature. If it is cold from either being stored in a cool location or from just being washed, don't immediately fill it with hot liquids. Wait a moment until your Mosser Glass item is at room temperature before filling with a hot pot of coffee or tea. Avoid the misuse of the microwave. Do not heat or use glass containers for heating food packaged in heat concentrated materials (such as popcorn). Don't add metal or tableware intoglassware. Use plastic or nylon utensils to cook","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41we0H0jlML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosso Glass","source_asin":"B01BH9REZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BH9REZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BH9REZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
