window.products.push({"id":959720,"name":"MUZII Ergonomic Office Chair, Computer Desk Chair Swivel Task Chair with Flip-up Arms and Adjustable Lumbar Support, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fzZ2z31PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ergonomic Design: The adjustable lumbar support of the ergonomic office chair fits the natural curve of the lower back, keeping you away from physical spinal pain. The high-density mesh back provides flexible support and breathability. When you are tired after a day of work, you can use this office chair at 90° - 120° swaying function to relieve fatigue. Comfortable Seating Experience: The thick foam cushion of computer chair covered with breathable mesh fabric, it makes the balance between firmness and comfort of the executive office chair. Comfortable office chair evenly distributes pressure on the hips and eliminates tailbone and spine pain. The breathable mesh backrest allows air, body heat and water vapor to escape through the seat and backrest, helping to maintain an even and comfortable skin temperature. Save Space: You can flip up the armrests and place the task chair under the desk to save space, Ideal for living rooms, dens, conference rooms and offices. When you're not using it, you can lower the back of the chair onto the seat cushion by pressing the buttons on either side of the home office desk chair. This way you can save a lot of space. Preminum Materials: This desk chair features a sturdy one-piece reinforced plastic frame with a iron leg base that can hold up to 250 pounds for extra protection. The computer chair's 360° swivel casters are made of powder coated, which not only improves wear resistance and gloss, but also allows you to move quietly in any direction, protecting your floor from damage. Customer Service: No matter what problems you encounter in the process of use, you can contact us. We will provide you with professional service on our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fzZ2z31PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUZII","source_asin":"B0BKZJNRVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZJNRVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZJNRVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":959721,"name":"Halcyon Collection, Sugar and Creamer Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ko+8J2b1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Fitz and Floyd's delightful Halcyon Sugar and Creamer Set features an adorable bunny rabbit, pastel pansies and blue plaid ribbon. The sugar bowl is shaped like a basket of pansies, with the bunny peeking over the top. Twining blossoms and a beautiful braided handle decorate the cream pitcher. Perfect for spring and summer decor, the Halcyon Sugar and Creamer Set makes a wonderful Easter or Mother's Day gift. Collectors of rabbit figurines will be thrilled to receive a gift from this collection at any time of year. The Halcyon Collection features adorable bunnies hiding in pastel flowers and leaves on a white background. The earthenware sugar bowl and creamer measure 7-1/4 Inch each. Hand-washing recommended. Fitz and Floyd is the undisputed leader in the design and manufacture of hand-painted ceramic giftware, dinnerware, tableware and decorative accessories. All Fitz and Floyd products are distinctly designed and hand-crafted by skilled artisans. Every Fitz and Floyd product is produced with meticulous craftsmanship and exquisite detail, whether it's a tea service for Her Majesty Queen Elizabeth II, Presidential dinnerware for the White House, or exquisite table settings for your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ko+8J2b1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fitz & Floyd","source_asin":"B00IWRUML0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IWRUML0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IWRUML0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":959722,"name":"Jumbl Tea Infuser Water Pitcher. Plastic Pitchers with spill proof Lid & Removable Infusion Insert For Kool Aid, Juice, Iced Tea, Lemon Water, Crystal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VoU6ttMaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pre-Chill Beverages Even Outdoors When setting the table a while before guests arrive, the beverage pitcher presents a common dilemma: Putting the entire thing in the freezer may cause you to forget it altogether, and setting is on the table with ice cubes often leaves you with watereddown drinks thanks to dilution from melting ice. The good news is that this clever Jumbl pitcher has been designed to deal with such dilemmas. Its included removable core can be filled with water and pre-frozen or simply filled with ready ice and then inserted into the pitcher to chill beverages without bringing the ice in actual contact with the liquid. Infuse Beverages with Gentle Flavors In addition to the ice section, this Jumbl pitcher’s included core features an infuser section. This section is designed to hold sliced fruits and/or flavor herbs such as strawberries, lemons, lime, oranges, mint leaves and more. The key difference between the two sections is that is that the infuser section is not sealed. Instead, it features narrow slits that allow for the flavors to mix into the liquid in the pitcher. The slits are also small enough to keep the fruits and herbs from floating around the pitcher. This provides you a hassle-free pouring experience and does away with the need to fish out the fruits from your drinking cup. Directions for Use 1. Unscrew lid off core  2. Fill ice section with tap water  3. Screw lid back onto ice core  4. Set core in freezer until frozen  5. Separate ice and infuser sections  6. Fill infuser section with fruit etc.  7. Screw two sections back together  8. Place core with lid into pitcher","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VoU6ttMaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jumbl","source_asin":"B00WIJYDAY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WIJYDAY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WIJYDAY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
