window.products.push({"id":959818,"name":"Royal Doulton Baroness 5-Piece Dinnerware Place Setting, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DGKQ1QYHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Baroness is a striking bone china pattern. This pattern features a rich design in a bold color pallet of black, gold and cream. Baroness creates a stunning dining setting that brings a touch of the dramatic to any table. A 5-Piece Place Setting includes: Dinner plate, Salad plate, Bread & Butter plate, Cup and Saucer. Amazon.com Royal Doulton, founded in 1815, is one of England's famed producers of fine bone china; its designers continue to draw on British history and heritage for inspiration. Although new in 2002, the Baroness pattern is evocative of 19th-century fashions from the heyday of British minor nobility. It uses trellis, fence, and floral motifs in a bold, rich palette of cream, taupe, black and gold. The Royal Doulton 5-piece Baroness dinnerware set includes one 10-1/2-inch dinner plate, one 8-inch salad plate, one 6-1/2-inch bread plate, one 6-inch saucer, and one 8-ounce teacup. The pattern features broad cream borders on glazed white bone china; the borders are decorated with fence and trellis designs in ecru and black. The outermost taupe and black border bands are punctuated with a feathery floral motif reminiscent of a Baroness's tiara ornament. The plates and saucer are detailed with gleaming gold edges, as are the teacup rim and handle. Matching pieces in the Baroness pattern include a rimmed soup bowl, a large and medium platter, and a sumptuous gravy or sauce boat. Because of the gold trim, Baroness dishes should not be used in the microwave. Though not designed to handle extreme temperature changes, Royal Doulton's Baroness china can be pre-warmed for serving in a 100-degree oven. Baroness china is dishwasher safe; it can handle water temperatures of up to 150 degrees F. When hand washing, avoid abrasive cleansers and scourers. When stacking for storage, the best way to avoid scratches is to place a paper napkin between each bowl or plate. The 5-piece place setting includes one 10-1/2-inch dinner plate, one 8-inch salad plate, one 6-1/2-inch bread plate, one 6-inch saucer, and one 8-ounce teacup. Royal Doulton guarantees that a chosen pattern will be available for two years after initial purchase. --Garland Withers What's in the Box 1 place setting. Place setting consists of: 10-1/2-inch (27 cm) dinner plate; 8-inch (20 cm) salad plate; 6-1/2-inch (16 cm) bread plate; 6-inch (15 cm) saucer; 8-ounce teacup. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DGKQ1QYHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Doulton","source_asin":"B0000CFDQL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CFDQL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CFDQL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":959819,"name":"Simple Deluxe 46’’ Electric Oscillating Tower Fan with Remote Control and Large LED Display, Great for Indoor, Bedroom and Home Office, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w3ctQhBaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Simple Deluxe Wind Curve Tower Fan is a 46” tall oscillating tower fan with remote control. The fan has a black body with a woodgrain face. If you live in the heat with no central air or window AC units do that a poor job of moving air around your whole house or apartment, this high-reaching stand fan with 3 speeds and optional oscillation provides maximum air delivery and full-room coverage to help you beat the heat. It is ideal for indoor, baby room, bedroom, dorm, kitchen, living room, home office. Powered by 3 quiet speeds, the fan produces a powerful breeze. Easy to assemble and operate. Built-in carry handle makes it easy to move from room to room. Electric timer option automatically turns the fan off after a period of up to 12-hours of use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w3ctQhBaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simple Deluxe","source_asin":"B08MF2VHXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MF2VHXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MF2VHXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":959820,"name":"CoasterStone Absorbent Coasters (Set of 4), White Marble, 4-1/4\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Kwdti+QEL._AC_.jpg","description":"CoasterStone art is truly absorbing! We are the creators of the first absorbent Coasters. We use a beautiful bone colored stone that is cork backed to prevent sliding and damage to furniture then packaged carefully in a printed box. Our unique Coasters are not sealed with any coating to assure that you get the most absorbent coaster. 4 ¼ inch diameter coaster suits most drinking glasses, tumblers, mugs and even flasks. CoasterStone offers the widest selection of art available in the marketplace. With over 2, 000 designs to choose from, CoasterStone can satisfy any style or preference. Coasters feature licensed artwork from nearly 50 artists, including Frank Lloyd Wright and Paul Brent. CoasterStone Coasters can easily be cleaned. Cleaning instructions are printed on every box of Coasters so you are able to keep your coasters working properly and beautiful for many years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Kwdti+QEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CoasterStone","source_asin":"B06VT1TYWR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06VT1TYWR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06VT1TYWR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
