window.products.push({"id":959898,"name":"Creo SmartGlass Cookware, 4-Cookware, Piece Nesting Bowl Set, Oven Safe and for Serving, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KCTGhVHoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you love food as much as we do, it's all about the journey. Designed for ease of use from prep to pour, these sturdy yet sleek nesting bowls are the perfect tool to help start your next adventure in the kitchen. So whip, mix and cream to your heart's content. We can wait to see what you bring to the table. Made of a revolutionary combination of a tempered borosilicate glass interior with a ceramic exterior for more consistent performance. Full Circle SmartGlass products are safe from oven to table to freezer. Microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe. While most top out at 350ºF/176ºC, all Smartglass pieces can go up to 450ºF/232ºC, which promotes the nutty caramelization that helps make your favorite dishes so special. And SmartGlass heats slowly, which means more even and consistent cooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KCTGhVHoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creo","source_asin":"B00OPAVQ7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OPAVQ7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OPAVQ7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":959899,"name":"Ecowood Costa Rica Extra Large Teak Wood Cutting Board For Kitchen. 1 single wood slab, no glue, natural live edge (14.5x11 inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+CL+WHw6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handmade with love in the costarican forest, natural teak wood cutting board treated with organic coconut oil, perfect for culinary application in kitchen or restaurants, or as serving tray in your table, ONE SOLID PIECE:it never crack or bend like bamboo or other cutting boards / chopping blocks made of more than one piece of wood glued together, What gives teak it’s unique strenght and impermeability is a combination of natural wood oils, tight wood grain and tensile strength. Whereas even other hardwoods such as acacia, maple and walnut need to have oils applied to keep water out, teak is one (if not the only) wood that retains it’s natural oils even after being processed, thats why is used in sailboats and outdoor furniture. This are the reasons why this amazons top quality cutting board is a must in your kitchen or restaurant. All our products are sourced from sustainable and environmental friendly teak plantations, Every cutting board is unique and different than the other ones because nature is the designer and nature never run out of ideas. We recommend to treat the cutting board with organic coconut oil couple times a year to highlight the colors and beauty of this exotic wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+CL+WHw6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecowood Costa Rica","source_asin":"B07TD2R1QL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TD2R1QL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TD2R1QL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":959900,"name":"VIVOYAN Kids Alarm Clock, Unicorn Alarm Clock for Girls with 4 Sides Unicorn Pattern and 9 LEDs Light Up Wake Up Bedside Clock Gift,for Unicorn Alarm ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715lDpIMvwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Included:1 color box1 alarm clock1 manual2 button batteries1 data line📕Color changing alarm clockThe unicorn bedside clock emits different LED light color changes to create a variety of atmospheres and also provides a night light for the kids to have great company at night!Children will have a lot of fun with this unicorn clock. Note: If you want to turn off the lights, the switch must be on \"OFF\".📕Features☞ Bright LED lights with 7 different color variations.☞ There are 8 kinds of ringtones to choose from☞ LED displays time (12 hours or 24 hours), data, day of the week and temperature (°F or°C).☞Alarm Clock has a snooze function for 1-60 minutes.☞High quality ABS body, free from toxic chemicals and certified by CE, ROHS and FCC. Rugged construction that won't break and remains resilient in the event of a fall.📕How to Use☞ Time setting: Press \"SET\" button, when the hours number begin to flicker, press \"UP\" and \"DOWN\" button to set hours. According set in the sequence of minute-year-month-day-week.☞ Alarm setting: Press \"ALL\" button, then press \"SET\", time flicker. Press \"UP\" and \"DOWN\" button to set alarm time, snooze function/alarms sound one by one.After pressing \"SET\", press \"UP\" to start alarm indicator.Press \"UP\" again to start the snooze function, finally press \"ALL\" button, all fixed.☞ Cancel the alarm: Press \"SET\" button☞ Stop the Alarm: Press any button except \"SET\" button☞ ℃/℉ switch: Under normal condition, press \"DOWN\" button to change☞ If you don't know how to set up, please contact us by email, we will help you to solve the problem.NOTE:> Screen Discoloration function powered by 4 AAA batteries (not included).> Follow the instructions to set up, if the setting is successful, the clock screen will display the symbol of the alarm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715lDpIMvwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIVOYAN","source_asin":"B09NN6YY5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NN6YY5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NN6YY5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
