window.products.push({"id":959962,"name":"Bread Proofing Basket, 9 Inch Round Banneton Proofing Basket with Linen Liners and Dough Scraper for Sourdough, Bread Rising Basket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ijKMExSBL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Material: Natural Rattan Size: 9 inch round bread proofing basket Package: 1 x round bread proof basket, 1 x sourdough cloth, 1 x dough scraper Feature: *Made of pure nature rattan, safe and eco-friendly. *Smooth surface and no wood bits. *Perfect for professional and home use. *Easy to use and easy to clean. How to work: 1.Place the dough cloth on the sourdough basket. 2.Coat the dough cloth with some flour. 3.In the last stage of rising, place the dough in the sourdough basket until it doubles its size. 4.After the dough has risen, gently transfer it from the basket to a baking product for oven. 5.Clean the cloth and the dough, dry them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ijKMExSBL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smilifea","source_asin":"B088MCG6ZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088MCG6ZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088MCG6ZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":959963,"name":"Waverly Marine Life Reversible 4 Piece Comforter Set, King, Pool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mMIrGBN3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Bring the coast to your bedroom with the Waverly Marine Life 4 Piece Reversible Comforter Collection. This striking comforter set features a whimsical study of coral branches and sea life in distinctive hues of blue, aqua, and ivory on a teal ground. Reverse pattern is a stunning ikat collage of sea glass shapes in coordinating colors on white ground. Each reversible comforter is crafted of 100% Cotton twill, creating just the right blend visual interest and surface texture. Decorative piping in reverse print outlines a 2 inch flange around the comforter and shams for a luxurious finish. Full/Queen comforter set features a 92\" x 96\" reversible comforter, two 21\" x 26\"standard shams, and a 60\" x 80\" tailored bed skirt with 15\" drop. King comforter set includes a 110\" x 96\" reversible comforter, two 21\" x 36\" reversible king shams, and a 78\" x 80\" tailored bed skirt with 15\" drop. The comforter, shams and bed skirt are machine washable for easy care. Wash in cold water on the gentle cycle and tumble dry on low for optimal care and long lasting beauty. Complete your designer look by layering on coordinating accent pillows and lined window treatments, all sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mMIrGBN3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAVERLY","source_asin":"B00OCXA7WC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OCXA7WC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OCXA7WC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":959964,"name":"Nothing But Love Home Lady in White with Flowers Pretty Woman Beauty Porcelain Figurine Statuette Figure Collectibles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vKpYI8rgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In 1710 a Dresden alchemist Johann Friedrich Böttger found out a formula of hard-paste porcelain similar to that made in China. He established a porcelain factory and started producing first European figurines - small statues depicting people from daily life, Biblical and historic characters, animals. The production was owned by the King of Saxony and Poland Augustus II the Strong, a great admirer of porcelain ware. And among the customers who ordered figurines were the most wealthy European families. Soon many other countries began producing their own figurines. Our figurines keep to classic 18th century style. They are modeled with great attention to details and hand painted in lifelike colors. Vintage porcelain figures feature flawless glazing and natural looking skin tones. Unique statuettes will add depth and warmth to your home decor. They also can become a wonderful gift for your beloved ones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vKpYI8rgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nothing But Love Home","source_asin":"B01I3JWDMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I3JWDMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I3JWDMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":959965,"name":"Circleware Nobless Set of 4 Stemless Wine Glasses, Drinking Glassware for Water, Juice, Beer, Liquor and Best Selling Kitchen & Home Dining Beverage G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oRkDIbLgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"- ENJOY your wine in the most comfortable and stylish 100% lead-free wine glasses - these amazing glasses are ideal for both red wine and white wine. They feature a bowl shape that enhances your wine's aromas and flavors. The bowl shape is the perfect all-purpose wine glass. - The glasses Do not contain any harmful chemicals such as BPA, phthalate, PVC, or polycarbonate, so nothing can leach into your beverage from the glass. - made of glass enabling the color of the wine to shine. Elegant look and adds to any table's aesthetics with their contemporary design. Increase the overall drinking experience and is strongly recommended by health experts. - shaped to perfection: the glasses are shaped to perfection with breakthrough styling and unmatched brand value. - shaped to be an all-purpose glass the base of this glass provides maximum stability. Ideal for juice and all beverages as well. - The unique Glass shape enhances the wines aromas and flavors. - stemless glasses are the younger brother/sister to the traditional wine glass. The stemless glass fits perfectly and comfortably in the palm of your hand. The glass is designed to hold both red and white wines alike, but it is argued that Red wines benefit from the warmth of a personal hand around the glass. - stemless glasses are eye-catching. They are innovative in design, style, and form. Ideal for contemporary bars or stylish restaurants. - the sturdy, solid design of stemless glasses makes them reliable and less likely to break, than the stems on traditional wine glasses. - stemless glasses can be used for informal or formal entertaining. - stemless glasses are considered to take away the anxiety related to holding a traditional wine glass. - stemless glasses are often described as ‘modern glassware’. - stemless glasses are used frequently by airlines, as an easier way to quickly and safely serve wine on board a flight. - these glasses are perfect for large gatherings or parties where (in most cases) glasses are more likely to get knocked over- the lack of stems makes them fit better just about anywhere you'd like to place them. - how many times have you accidentally knocked over your conventional glass? Designed with a flat base and no awkward stem makes the stemless variety a pretty stable vessel. The lower center of gravity is a key factor in avoiding mishaps. - isn't it irritating to that your glasses are too tall for your shelves? Being half the height, The stemless glass fits like a dream into any cupboard and takes up way less space- do you ever spill when swirling in conventional glasses? A stemless glass fits comfortably into the palm of the hand for more control when swirling- investing in a good set of stemless wine glasses will not only make your life A little easier in terms of cutting out spillage and breakage risks, but it will save you money on replacement and cleanup costs in the future too! - They are easier to use for gatherings and parties you want all of your parties to be chic but there is nothing chic about dozens of broken glasses and everyone trying to find a good place to sit their drink. Stemless wine glasses are easier to use at parties because they are not as fragile as stemmed glasses and they are also more casual. Using this sturdier glass allows you to worry less about your favorite glasses breaking and more time to worry about having a great time with friends. - the glasses reflect a style More in line with today's casual entertaining. By removing the stems from the glasses, They appear much less formal and more approachable, inviting every day and casual use. - increase the overall drinking experience and is strongly recommended by wine experts around the globe. - has an elegant look in a wine cabinet and adds to any table's aesthetics with its contemporary design. - at almost every special occasion, people choose to share a cup of wine. How would you like having glasses that feature a unique design and provide you with incomparable flavor satisfaction? These amazing wine glasses are ideal for all beverages as well. They feature a shape that enhances your beverages aromas and flavors. - what is more, Their base provides the maximum stability that will add to your table's aesthetics with their contemporary design. - glass fixes the problem of keeping the outside out while simultaneously letting you rest at ease knowing that with every Sip from your bottle, you’re just drinking The water and not the bottle! - why Choose a glass over plastic? It allows you to Sip colder and more pure-tasting water, looks sleek and elegant, and is thicker and sturdier than plastic. Glass is also better for the planet: made from all-natural, sustainable raw materials, glass is 100% recyclable and can be reused endlessly. - glass is the only packaging material generally regarded as safe by the U. S. Food & drug Administration. Glass is made from all-natural, sustainable raw materials, is 100% recyclable, and can be recycled endlessly with no los","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oRkDIbLgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Circleware","source_asin":"B07FMMTR6B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FMMTR6B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FMMTR6B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
