window.products.push({"id":959970,"name":"LooQoo Electric Can Opener,Restaurant Can Opener Your Cans with A Simple Push of Button - No Sharp Edge,Food-Safe and Battery Operated Handheld Can Op","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XP8GMtgXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Size: Brand new mini electric can opener. Opening Cans with Simple Press! No Sharp Edge. Place the cans on a flat table, attach the can opener to your can and press the button of the top. Just rotate 360 degrees, Effortless can opening in one easy motion!; Operating the Can Opener: Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel. With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can. When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter. Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can. Trouble Shooting: If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener. Technical Specifications. Operate voltage: DC2.4 - 3V. Battery: 2xAA alkaline or rechargeable batteries(Battery Not Included). Can cutting size: diameter 52mm - 153mm(2 inches - 6 inches ). Maximum can cutting size in one cycle: diameter 98mm (3.85 inches)(preferred).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XP8GMtgXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LooQoo","source_asin":"B08RYTVCQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-959970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RYTVCQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RYTVCQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
